# a6443: the music panel in Spotify's look (home-music, home-music-full, home-music-keys, home-music-time). Dark glass, the art rounded, the title strong, the artist soft, white controls with a round white play. Spotify's green is a STATE only (liked, shuffle or repeat on, playing): it is its own token, not LAMPLIT's accent, which means an agent at work. Nothing moves; the bar steps once a second.
token spotify = #1ED760
